#. phantasmSealCopy.coursework.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:15
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.coursework.name"
msgid "An answer submitted"
msgstr "交出去的答案"

#. phantasmSealCopy.coursework.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:16
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.coursework.missing"
msgid ""
"An assignment slip is waiting. Only an answer written and submitted counts "
"as a chosen route."
msgstr "有一張作業紙還在等你承認：寫下來的答案才算選過。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.coursework.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:17
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.coursework.found"
msgid "Another answer appears behind the grading seal and insists it also earned marks."
msgstr "批改章背面浮出另一個答案；那個答案聲稱自己也得過分。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.governance.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:21
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.governance.name"
msgid "The ballot not cast"
msgstr "沒有投下的那一票"

#. phantasmSealCopy.governance.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:22
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.governance.missing"
msgid "The senate box has three mouths. Two have not yet learned the shape of your hand."
msgstr "校務院的票匭有三個口；你尚未讓其中兩個口記住你的手。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.governance.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:23
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.governance.found"
msgid ""
"The minority ballot passes in the shadow senate and asks the ordinary "
"chamber to prove it is more real."
msgstr "少數票在影子議場宣布通過，並要求正式議場證明自己比較真。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.incident.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:27
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.incident.name"
msgid "A hypothesis closure excluded"
msgstr "被結案排除的假說"

#. phantasmSealCopy.incident.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:28
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.incident.missing"
msgid "One incident binder still lacks a closure seal on its reverse."
msgstr "事件中心仍有一個案卷夾沒有反面的結案章。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.incident.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:29
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.incident.found"
msgid ""
"The rejected hypothesis becomes the official dream conclusion; the ordinary "
"finding is asked to resubmit evidence."
msgstr "被退回的假說在夢裡成為正式結論，原結論則被要求補交證據。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.housing.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:33
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.housing.name"
msgid "A room door declined"
msgstr "拒絕過的房門"

#. phantasmSealCopy.housing.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:34
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.housing.missing"
msgid "The housing desk's second key has no room number and has not been returned."
msgstr "宿舍辦的第二把鑰匙沒有房號，也沒有被退回。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.housing.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:35
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.housing.found"
msgid ""
"The room you declined marks you present each day; its roommate says they "
"borrowed your pillow last night."
msgstr "你沒有接受的房間每天替你點名；那位室友堅稱昨夜借過你的枕頭。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.course.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:39
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.course.name"
msgid "The class still meeting after withdrawal"
msgstr "退選後仍在上的課"

#. phantasmSealCopy.course.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:40
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.course.missing"
msgid "The ninth-period timetable can only be printed on the reverse of a drop stamp."
msgstr "第九節課表只能用退選章的背面印刷。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.course.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:41
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.course.found"
msgid ""
"The dropped course meets in a nonexistent ninth period; only your name is "
"circled on the absence roll."
msgstr "退選課在不存在的第九節照常上課；缺席名單只有你的名字被圈起。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:45
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.name"
msgid "The unused route acknowledged in defence"
msgstr "答辯承認的未行路線"

#. phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.missing
#: src/data/phantasm.js:46
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.missing"
msgid ""
"The defence bench is not waiting for the route you took. It wants the route "
"you deliberately left unused, in your own hand."
msgstr "答辯席不問你走了哪條路；它在等你親手寫出為何沒有走另一條。"

#. phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.found
#: src/data/phantasm.js:47
msgctxt "text:phantasmSealCopy.unused-route.found"
msgid ""
"The unused route has erected its own signposts and requests a citation from "
"your official thesis."
msgstr "那條未採用路線已自行補上路標，並向你的正式論文索取引用。"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:55
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.title"
msgid "Ninth Period: Practicum in Routes Not Taken"
msgstr "第九節：未選路線實習"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:56
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.teacher"
msgid "Doremy Sweet (denies teaching while awake)"
msgstr "多蕾米・蘇伊特（醒著時不承認授課）"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:57
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.credits"
msgid "−3 / +3 credits"
msgstr "−3／＋3 學分"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:58
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.room"
msgid "Fourth floor, downstairs from the north stair"
msgstr "北樓梯向下的四樓"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:59
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Split one real decision into at least three untaken branches. Submit only "
"the version you did not use; the final must be unfindable after waking."
msgstr "把一次確實做過的選擇拆成至少三條未走分支；每週只提交沒有採用的版本。期末作品必須在醒來後找不到。"

#. phantasmCourses.PH-009.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:60
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.PH-009.assessment"
msgid "Absence 40% · non-submission 30% · punctual arrival at the wrong room 30%"
msgstr "缺席 40%・未交 30%・在錯誤教室準時到達 30%"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:66
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.title"
msgid "Dream Historiography: Official Events That Never Happened"
msgstr "夢中史料學：沒有發生過的正史"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:67
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.teacher"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa / another Keine who refuses to sign"
msgstr "上白澤慧音／不肯簽名的另一位慧音"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:68
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.credits"
msgid "4 credits (displayed as 0 after waking)"
msgstr "4 學分（醒後顯示 0）"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:69
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.room"
msgid "Hieda Hall, between deleted page numbers"
msgstr "稗田館・被刪除的頁碼之間"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:70
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Write an excluded incident hypothesis as university history, then refute it "
"with the original evidence. Both contradictory editions share one archive "
"number."
msgstr "把被結案排除的假說寫成校史，再以原本的證物反駁它。兩份互相否定的稿件必須使用同一個檔案號。"

#. phantasmCourses.DRM-404.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:71
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DRM-404.assessment"
msgid "Version-difference viva 60% · making Akyuu misplace edition one 40%"
msgstr "版本差異口試 60%・讓阿求找不到第一版 40%"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:77
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.title"
msgid "Shadow Senate: Making the Minority Decision Already True"
msgstr "影子議場：少數票既成事實演習"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:78
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.teacher"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo (one seat inside and one outside the roll)"
msgstr "八雲紫（出席名冊內外各一席）"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:79
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.credits"
msgid "2 + unvoted credits"
msgstr "2＋未表決學分"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:80
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.room"
msgid "The underside of the senate table"
msgstr "評議會室桌面的背面"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:81
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Implement the option you did not vote for, then require the chosen option to "
"submit an impact assessment. Aya claims the scoop in both chambers."
msgstr "先執行你沒有投的方案，再要求你已投的方案提交影響評估。文負責在兩邊都宣布自己先報導。"

#. phantasmCourses.GOV-000.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:82
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.GOV-000.assessment"
msgid "Rule friction 50% · completing the second vote before Corrections 50%"
msgstr "規章摩擦 50%・在訂正刊出前完成第二次表決 50%"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:88
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.title"
msgid "Unmatched Residential Life: The Roommate You Declined"
msgstr "未配對共同生活：拒絕過的室友"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:89
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.teacher"
msgid "Residence Council Seat Thirteen (currently empty)"
msgstr "宿舍自治會第十三席（座位目前空著）"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:90
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.credits"
msgid "1 pillow credit + night practicum"
msgstr "1 枕學分＋夜間實習"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:91
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.room"
msgid "The room you declined, with its plate on another hall"
msgstr "你拒絕的房號，但門牌在別棟"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:92
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Negotiate sleep, moonlight, walls, and refrigerator liability with someone "
"who never became your roommate. “We do not live together” is not closure."
msgstr "與一位沒有成為室友的人協商作息、月相、牆面與冰箱責任。不得用「反正沒住一起」結案。"

#. phantasmCourses.DOR-013.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:93
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.DOR-013.assessment"
msgid "Agreement inside the door 50% · reconsideration outside 50%"
msgstr "門內協議 50%・門外反悔 50%"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:99
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.title"
msgid "Negative Circulation: Holdings That Refute Their Readers"
msgstr "否定借閱學：會反駁讀者的館藏"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:100
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.teacher"
msgid "Koakuma / a return stamp with no borrower"
msgstr "小惡魔／一枚沒有借閱人的還書章"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:101
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.credits"
msgid "3 volumes (not 3 credits)"
msgstr "3 本（不是 3 學分）"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:102
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.room"
msgid "Beyond the Misty Lake return slot"
msgstr "霧湖館還書口之後"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:103
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Return a book insisting you never borrowed it. Prove acquaintance through "
"call number, creases, and overdue dreams; the book may place a hold on "
"testimony."
msgstr "歸還一本堅稱你從未借過的書；以索書號、折角與逾期夢證明你們曾經見面。書可對證詞提出預約。"

#. phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:104
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.LIB-NULL.assessment"
msgid "Returning the book 0% · being returned by it 100%"
msgstr "還書 0%・被書歸還 100%"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:110
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.title"
msgid "Reverse Campus Survey: Floors, Boundaries, and Waking Direction"
msgstr "裏側校園測量：樓層、邊界與醒來方向"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:111
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.teacher"
msgid "Yukari / Doremy (each cedes the chair to the other)"
msgstr "八雲紫／多蕾米（兩人都把主考席讓給對方）"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:112
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.credits"
msgid "∞ credits, finite component counted"
msgstr "∞ 學分，僅取有限部分"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:113
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.room"
msgid "Where the campus map is creased"
msgstr "校園地圖折線壓過的地方"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:114
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.syllabus"
msgid ""
"Survey one building before the bell, after it, and when it never rang. Route "
"reports may not assume the destination consents to arrival."
msgstr "測量同一棟樓在鐘響前、鐘響後、沒有鐘響三種狀態的入口；導航報告不得假設目的地願意被抵達。"

#. phantasmCourses.BND--.assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:115
msgctxt "text:phantasmCourses.BND--.assessment"
msgid "Map 30% · crease 30% · defence of the deliberately unused route 40%"
msgstr "地圖 30%・折痕 30%・解釋刻意未走的路 40%"

#. phantasmNodes.north-stair.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:124
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.north-stair.title"
msgid "The fourth floor reached by descending"
msgstr "向下抵達的四樓"

#. phantasmNodes.north-stair.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:125
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.north-stair.role"
msgid "Ninth-period common hall"
msgstr "第九節共同講堂"

#. phantasmNodes.north-stair.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:126
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.north-stair.body"
msgid ""
"Every step down raises the floor number. Students ask you not to count "
"backward because the steps behind are dropping the course."
msgstr "北樓梯每下一階，樓層牌增加一層。學生會要求你不要回頭數，因為後面的台階正在辦退選。"

#. phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:133
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.title"
msgid "Shadow Senate"
msgstr "影子議場"

#. phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:134
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.role"
msgid "Office for implementing uncast options"
msgstr "未投選項先行施行處"

#. phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:135
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.shadow-senate.body"
msgid ""
"The agenda above and below the table veto each other. Aya tapes a correction "
"to the edge: “This paper supports the last proposal passed first.”"
msgstr "桌上議程與桌下議程互相否決。文在桌沿貼了一條勘誤：『本報支持最先通過的最後方案。』"

#. phantasmNodes.room-404.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:142
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.room-404.title"
msgid "Room 404, never assigned to you"
msgstr "沒有分配給你的 404 室"

#. phantasmNodes.room-404.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:143
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.room-404.role"
msgid "Unmatched residence practicum"
msgstr "未配對住宿實習室"

#. phantasmNodes.room-404.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:144
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.room-404.body"
msgid ""
"Inside is footwear that is not yours; outside, your nameplate. The roommate "
"is angry you did not come home last night."
msgstr "門內留著一雙不是你的拖鞋，門外名牌卻寫你的名字。室友正為你昨晚沒有回來而生氣。"

#. phantasmNodes.reverse-library.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:151
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.reverse-library.title"
msgid "The library behind the return slot"
msgstr "還書口後方的圖書館"

#. phantasmNodes.reverse-library.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:152
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.reverse-library.role"
msgid "Negative loans and reversed call numbers"
msgstr "否定借閱與倒置索書"

#. phantasmNodes.reverse-library.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:153
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.reverse-library.body"
msgid ""
"Every spine faces inward. Readers must recite the last page to borrow the "
"first. A returned volume insists it borrowed you."
msgstr "所有書背朝內，讀者要先說出最後一頁才能借到第一頁。一本歸還書堅稱是它借閱了你。"

#. phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:160
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.title"
msgid "The bell tower that only strikes nine"
msgstr "只敲第九下的鐘樓"

#. phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:161
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.role"
msgid "Dream-campus time standard"
msgstr "夢境校區時間基準"

#. phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:162
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.ninth-bell.body"
msgid ""
"The ordinary campus handles strikes one through eight. This tower keeps only "
"the ninth; each ring changes whether campus is before, after, or without a "
"bell."
msgstr "第一到第八下由普通校區負責。這座鐘只保管第九下；每敲一次，校園就改口說現在是鐘前、鐘後，或從未有鐘。"

#. phantasmNodes.unused-gate.title
#: src/data/phantasm.js:169
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.unused-gate.title"
msgid "The gate deliberately not taken"
msgstr "刻意沒有走的校門"

#. phantasmNodes.unused-gate.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:170
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.unused-gate.role"
msgid "Boundary between waking and staying enrolled"
msgstr "醒來與繼續上課的分界"

#. phantasmNodes.unused-gate.body
#: src/data/phantasm.js:171
msgctxt "text:phantasmNodes.unused-gate.body"
msgid ""
"There is no lock, only a defence form asking why you did not use this gate. "
"It opens when answered, not necessarily on the same side."
msgstr "門上沒有鎖，只有一張要求說明『為何不走這裡』的答辯表。寫完後門會打開，但不保證在同一邊。"

#. phantasmExaminers.doremy.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:180
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.doremy.name"
msgid "Doremy Sweet"
msgstr "多蕾米・蘇伊特"

#. phantasmExaminers.doremy.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:181
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.doremy.role"
msgid "Acting Dream Registrar / dream eater"
msgstr "夢境校務代理／食夢人"

#. phantasmExaminers.yukari.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:185
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.yukari.name"
msgid "Yukari Yakumo"
msgstr "八雲紫"

#. phantasmExaminers.yukari.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:186
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.yukari.role"
msgid "Boundary chair for campus front and reverse"
msgstr "校區裏側與表側邊界席"

#. phantasmExaminers.keine.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:190
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.keine.name"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa"
msgstr "上白澤慧音"

#. phantasmExaminers.keine.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:191
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.keine.role"
msgid "Provisional reviewer of history that did not happen"
msgstr "未發生校史臨時審閱"

#. phantasmExaminers.reimu.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:195
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.reimu.name"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗靈夢"

#. phantasmExaminers.reimu.role
#: src/data/phantasm.js:196
msgctxt "text:phantasmExaminers.reimu.role"
msgid "Chair for waking costs and inconvenience"
msgstr "醒來成本與麻煩裁定席"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.new.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:203
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.new.name"
msgid "Touhou University · Moonless Dream Campus"
msgstr "幻想鄉立東方大學・無月夢境校"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.new.short
#: src/data/phantasm.js:204
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.new.short"
msgid "MOONLESS DREAM AFFAIRS"
msgstr "無月校務處"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.new.motto
#: src/data/phantasm.js:205
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.new.motto"
msgid "When the moon is absent, its shadow teaches"
msgstr "沒有月亮時，影子自行代課"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:209
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.name"
msgid "Touhou University · Ninth-Period Campus"
msgstr "幻想鄉立東方大學・第九節分校"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.short
#: src/data/phantasm.js:210
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.short"
msgid "NINTH-PERIOD DREAM REGISTRY"
msgstr "第九節夢境學籍"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.motto
#: src/data/phantasm.js:211
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waxing.motto"
msgid "Enrol by the moonlight not yet completed"
msgstr "沿尚未走完的月光入學"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.full.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:215
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.full.name"
msgid "Touhou University · Full-Moon Reverse Campus"
msgstr "幻想鄉立東方大學・滿月反面校區"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.full.short
#: src/data/phantasm.js:216
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.full.short"
msgid "FULL-MOON REVERSE SENATE"
msgstr "滿月臨時校務院"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.full.motto
#: src/data/phantasm.js:217
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.full.motto"
msgid "Every untaken route claims to be the main gate tonight"
msgstr "所有沒選的路，今夜都聲稱自己是正門"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.name
#: src/data/phantasm.js:221
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.name"
msgid "Touhou University · Untaken-Route Campus"
msgstr "幻想鄉立東方大學・未行路線校區"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.short
#: src/data/phantasm.js:222
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.short"
msgid "REVERSE-RECORDS OFFICE"
msgstr "反面學籍保存處"

#. phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.motto
#: src/data/phantasm.js:223
msgctxt "text:phantasmBrandProfiles.waning.motto"
msgid "After moonlight recedes, the crease still calls your name"
msgstr "月光退去後，折痕仍替你點名"

#. phantasmCopy/lockedEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedEyebrow"
msgid "BOUNDARY REGISTRAR / DREAM AFFAIRS (NOT ESTABLISHED)"
msgstr "BOUNDARY REGISTRAR / 夢境校務處（未設立）"

#. phantasmCopy/lockedTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedTitle"
msgid "There is no campus on this page. That is the university's answer."
msgstr "本頁沒有校區。至少校方這樣回答。"

#. phantasmCopy/lockedLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedLead"
msgid ""
"Entering the address directly reaches only a desk without a floor. Six "
"ordinary records must first acquire reverse sides on this device; only then "
"do date, lunar phase, and the duty bell begin choosing an entrance."
msgstr "直接輸入網址只會抵達一張沒有樓層的辦公桌。六份普通校務記錄必須先在同一台裝置上留下反面；此後日期、月相與當值校鐘才開始決定入口。"

#. phantasmCopy/lockedCount
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedCount"
msgid "reverse sides visible"
msgstr "張反面已浮出"

#. phantasmCopy/lockedNote
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/lockedNote"
msgid ""
"Do not complete a checklist. Study, vote, close, decline, drop, and defend "
"as usual. If the ninth period needs you, it will leave its own blank in the "
"timetable."
msgstr "不要照清單完成。照常讀書、投票、結案、拒絕、退選與答辯；若第九節真的需要你，它會自己在課表上留下空格。"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryEyebrow"
msgid "LUNAR BOUNDARY DESK / NO VERBAL DIRECTIONS TODAY"
msgstr "LUNAR BOUNDARY DESK / 今日不受理口頭問路"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryTitle"
msgid "Six seals prove only eligibility; moonshadow decides which page you fall asleep through."
msgstr "六印只證明你有資格；今天從哪一頁睡著，由月影決定。"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryLead"
msgid ""
"The entrance changes duty every three hours. New and full moons may admit "
"two doors at once. Every day contains at least two ordinary opening windows; "
"enough different wrong doors will also wear a temporary seam through the "
"paper."
msgstr "入口每三小時換一次值班位置；朔月與滿月偶爾同時承認兩扇門。每天至少有兩個開門時段。若你反覆摸到不同的錯門，紙張也會被磨出一條臨時縫。"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryDate
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryDate"
msgid "Date on paper"
msgstr "紙面日期"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryMoon
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryMoon"
msgid "Eight-phase moon"
msgstr "八相月齡"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryBell
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryBell"
msgid "Duty bell"
msgstr "當值校鐘"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryDoor
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryDoor"
msgid "Moonshadow note"
msgstr "月影批註"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryAttempts
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryAttempts"
msgid "Wrong-door traces"
msgstr "錯門痕跡"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryAttemptUnit
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryAttemptUnit"
msgid "places / temporary seam"
msgstr "處／臨時縫"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryWaiting
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryWaiting"
msgid ""
"The present bell has not written an entrance on this page. Another ordinary "
"window will still rotate through today."
msgstr "本值鐘尚未把入口寫在這一頁；下一個正常窗口仍會在今日輪到。"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryResonant
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryResonant"
msgid "This door is warm now, but only fresh ink carried from its original page may pass."
msgstr "這扇門現在有溫度，但只有從原頁留下的新墨才能穿過。"

#. phantasmCopy/boundaryFrayed
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/boundaryFrayed"
msgid ""
"Wrong doors have thinned the boundary. Approach once more from any reverse "
"carrying fresh ink."
msgstr "錯門已把邊界磨薄；再從任一有新墨的反面靠近一次。"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/0
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/0"
msgid "New moon"
msgstr "朔月"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/1
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/1"
msgid "Waxing crescent"
msgstr "眉月"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/2
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/2"
msgid "Before first quarter"
msgstr "上弦前"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/3
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/3"
msgid "Waxing gibbous"
msgstr "盈凸月"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/4
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/4"
msgid "Full moon"
msgstr "滿月"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/5
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/5"
msgid "Waning gibbous"
msgstr "虧凸月"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/6
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/6"
msgid "After last quarter"
msgstr "下弦後"

#. phantasmCopy/moonNames/7
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/moonNames/7"
msgid "Waning crescent"
msgstr "殘月"

#. phantasmCopy/returnMytu
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/returnMytu"
msgid "Return to My TU"
msgstr "返回 My TU"

#. phantasmCopy/openOrdinary
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/openOrdinary"
msgid "View the ordinary timetable"
msgstr "查看普通課表"

#. phantasmCopy/campusEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/campusEyebrow"
msgid "PHANTASM / REVERSE CAMPUS"
msgstr "PHANTASM / REVERSE CAMPUS"

#. phantasmCopy/campusTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/campusTitle"
msgid "Dream Campus begins along the routes you did not take."
msgstr "夢境校區在你沒有走的路上開學。"

#. phantasmCopy/campusLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/campusLead"
msgid ""
"This is not another life. It temporarily enrols the branches ordinary "
"administration excluded, declined, dropped, or left unvoted. After waking, "
"the official ledger still recognises only the original choices."
msgstr "這裡不收藏另一套人生，而是把正式校務排除、拒絕、退選與沒投的分支暫時編成學籍。醒來後，普通帳本仍然只承認原來的選擇。"

#. phantasmCopy/dreamTime
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/dreamTime"
msgid "Dream campus time"
msgstr "夢境校時"

#. phantasmCopy/bellLabels/before
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/bellLabels/before"
msgid "Before the ninth strike"
msgstr "第九響之前"

#. phantasmCopy/bellLabels/ninth
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/bellLabels/ninth"
msgid "During the ninth strike"
msgstr "第九響正在發生"

#. phantasmCopy/bellLabels/after
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/bellLabels/after"
msgid "After the ninth strike"
msgstr "第九響之後"

#. phantasmCopy/bellLabels/never
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/bellLabels/never"
msgid "The bell never rang today"
msgstr "本日從未鳴鐘"

#. phantasmCopy/ring
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/ring"
msgid "Ring the ninth strike once"
msgstr "敲一次第九響"

#. phantasmCopy/mapTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/mapTitle"
msgid "Reverse-campus crease map"
msgstr "裏側校園折線圖"

#. phantasmCopy/mapLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/mapLead"
msgid "Nodes rearrange with the ninth strike. A route does not promise to consent to arrival."
msgstr "節點會隨第九響重排；路徑不保證同意被抵達。"

#. phantasmCopy/selectedPlace
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/selectedPlace"
msgid "Place currently admitting existence"
msgstr "目前承認存在的地點"

#. phantasmCopy/transcriptEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/transcriptEyebrow"
msgid "TU-DREAM-TRANSCRIPT"
msgstr "TU-DREAM-TRANSCRIPT"

#. phantasmCopy/transcriptTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/transcriptTitle"
msgid "Untaken-Route Student Copy"
msgstr "未選路線學籍副本"

#. phantasmCopy/invalid
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/invalid"
msgid "Not valid outside the dream boundary"
msgstr "Not valid outside the dream boundary"

#. phantasmCopy/officialWarning
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/officialWarning"
msgid "This copy never writes to My TU, the official transcript, or the campus event ledger."
msgstr "本副本不寫入 My TU、正式成績單或校園事件帳本。"

#. phantasmCopy/ordinaryColumn
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/ordinaryColumn"
msgid "Record left while awake"
msgstr "醒著時留下的記錄"

#. phantasmCopy/dreamColumn
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/dreamColumn"
msgid "How Dream Campus enrols it"
msgstr "夢境校區的編法"

#. phantasmCopy/noLibrary
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/noLibrary"
msgid ""
"No returned volume has yet denied meeting you. Entry is unaffected; Negative "
"Circulation remains audit-only."
msgstr "還沒有一本歸還書願意否認見過你。這不影響入校，只會讓否定借閱學暫列旁聽。"

#. phantasmCopy/coursesEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/coursesEyebrow"
msgid "NINTH-PERIOD REGISTRATION"
msgstr "NINTH-PERIOD REGISTRATION"

#. phantasmCopy/coursesTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/coursesTitle"
msgid "Ninth-period registration"
msgstr "第九節選課"

#. phantasmCopy/coursesLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/coursesLead"
msgid ""
"Choose three. The credit limit is outside the dream boundary, but one you "
"cannot occupy four nonexistent rooms at once."
msgstr "選三門。學分上限位於夢境邊界之外，但同一個你不能同時坐在四間不存在的教室裡。"

#. phantasmCopy/selected
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/selected"
msgid "Enrolled"
msgstr "已選"

#. phantasmCopy/choose
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/choose"
msgid "Add to ninth period"
msgstr "選入第九節"

#. phantasmCopy/drop
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/drop"
msgid "Drop from the dream"
msgstr "從夢裡退選"

#. phantasmCopy/bonusLocked
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/bonusLocked"
msgid "Audit condition: return one book in the ordinary library"
msgstr "旁聽條件：先在普通圖書館歸還一本書"

#. phantasmCopy/schedule
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/schedule"
msgid "Period"
msgstr "時段"

#. phantasmCopy/scheduleValue
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/scheduleValue"
msgid "Ninth / when the bell strikes"
msgstr "第九節／鐘響時"

#. phantasmCopy/credits
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/credits"
msgid "Credits"
msgstr "學分"

#. phantasmCopy/room
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/room"
msgid "Room"
msgstr "教室"

#. phantasmCopy/teacher
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/teacher"
msgid "Instructor"
msgstr "授課"

#. phantasmCopy/syllabus
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/syllabus"
msgid "Syllabus"
msgstr "課程內容"

#. phantasmCopy/assessment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/assessment"
msgid "Assessment"
msgstr "考核"

#. phantasmCopy/selectedCount
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/selectedCount"
msgid "dream courses selected"
msgstr "門夢課已選"

#. phantasmCopy/defenceEyebrow
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/defenceEyebrow"
msgid "REVERSE VIVA / PUBLIC DEFENCE"
msgstr "REVERSE VIVA / 公開反向答辯"

#. phantasmCopy/defenceTitle
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/defenceTitle"
msgid "Defend the route you did not take."
msgstr "替沒有採用的路線答辯。"

#. phantasmCopy/defenceLead
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/defenceLead"
msgid ""
"Choose one reverse record. Explain why the dream should retain it and why it "
"must not secretly rewrite the waking decision. Three dream courses and "
"twenty-four characters are required."
msgstr "選一份反面記錄，說明它為何值得被夢保存、又為何不應偷偷改寫醒著時的決定。三門夢課與至少二十四字的陳述缺一不可。"

#. phantasmCopy/fragment
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/fragment"
msgid "Defence file"
msgstr "答辯案卷"

#. phantasmCopy/examiner
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/examiner"
msgid "Examiner"
msgstr "主考席"

#. phantasmCopy/statement
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/statement"
msgid "Why was this route not taken, and what should the dream retain?"
msgstr "為何沒有走這條路？它應該在夢裡保留什麼？"

#. phantasmCopy/statementPlaceholder
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/statementPlaceholder"
msgid ""
"For example: I did not use it because… Yet it still exposes what the "
"original method never asked…"
msgstr "例如：我沒有採用它，因為……；但它仍能暴露原方法沒有問到的……"

#. phantasmCopy/submitDefence
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/submitDefence"
msgid "Submit reverse viva"
msgstr "提交反向答辯"

#. phantasmCopy/needCourses
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/needCourses"
msgid "Choose three ninth-period courses first."
msgstr "先選滿三門第九節課。"

#. phantasmCopy/needStatement
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/needStatement"
msgid "The statement needs at least twenty-four characters; an ellipsis is not another route."
msgstr "陳述至少二十四字；省略號不算另一條路。"

#. phantasmCopy/completed
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/completed"
msgid "The reverse viva is sealed in dream records and does not alter the official ledger."
msgstr "反向答辯已封存於夢學籍，不影響正式帳本。"

#. phantasmCopy/records
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/records"
msgid "Dream transcript history"
msgstr "歷次夢學籍"

#. phantasmCopy/noRecords
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/noRecords"
msgid ""
"No dream transcript is sealed. The bell tower calls this normal and also "
"says it does not exist today."
msgstr "還沒有封存的夢學籍。鐘樓說這是正常的，鐘樓今天也說自己不存在。"

#. phantasmCopy/ruling
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/ruling"
msgid "Ruling"
msgstr "裁定"

#. phantasmCopy/conditions
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/conditions"
msgid "Dream-boundary conditions"
msgstr "夢境附帶條件"

#. phantasmCopy/dissent
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/dissent"
msgid "Minority opinion"
msgstr "少數意見"

#. phantasmCopy/print
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/print"
msgid "Print / save dream transcript PDF"
msgstr "列印／另存夢學籍 PDF"

#. phantasmCopy/share
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/share"
msgid "Share this dream transcript"
msgstr "分享這份夢學籍"

#. phantasmCopy/wake
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/wake"
msgid "Wake up with one unreliable memory"
msgstr "醒來，帶走一點不可靠的記憶"

#. phantasmCopy/wakeNote
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/wakeNote"
msgid ""
"Waking does not delete dream records or insert them into the official "
"ledger. BBS may ignore the second half."
msgstr "醒來不會刪除夢學籍，也不會把它塞進正式帳本；BBS 可能不遵守後半句。"

#. phantasmCopy/student
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/student"
msgid "Dream student"
msgstr "夢境學生"

#. phantasmCopy/studentFallback
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/studentFallback"
msgid "Unregistered auditor"
msgstr "未登錄的旁聽者"

#. phantasmCopy/issued
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/issued"
msgid "Dream issue"
msgstr "夢境編發"

#. phantasmCopy/coursesLabel
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/coursesLabel"
msgid "Ninth-period courses"
msgstr "第九節修課"

#. phantasmCopy/defended
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/defended"
msgid "Untaken route defended"
msgstr "答辯的未行路線"

#. phantasmCopy/residue
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/residue"
msgid "Waking residue"
msgstr "醒後殘留"

#. phantasmCopy/residueLabels/0
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/residueLabels/0"
msgid "North-stair chalk on your shoe"
msgstr "鞋底多了一點北樓梯的粉筆灰"

#. phantasmCopy/residueLabels/1
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/residueLabels/1"
msgid "One timetable cell refusing erasure"
msgstr "課表背面有一格不肯被擦掉"

#. phantasmCopy/residueLabels/2
#: src/data/phantasm.js:227
msgctxt "tree:phantasmCopy#/residueLabels/2"
msgid "A never-borrowed book remembers your call number"
msgstr "一本沒有借過的書記得你的索書號"

